meta {
  name: one browser action
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/browser-wire/action/{{actionId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  One action's two recorded lines, parsed: {call, result}, with result null while the call is still open. The scan stops as soon as both are found. 400 for a cid that is not UUID-shaped; 404 for a foreign caller, a malformed id, a missing sidecar or an unknown action.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
